'''Rag Mega''' is a [[boss]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]]'' that can appear in all environments of [[Chapter 2]] ({{s|Caves}}, {{s|Catacombs}}, {{s|Flooded Caves}}).

== Behavior ==
Rag Mega spawns with 3 {{e|Purple Ball}}s which are immune to damage and block shots. They circle around him as he floats around the room while he performs the following attacks:
* Each time Rag Mega loses around 25% HP, he breaks off a Purple Ball which starts to chase Isaac.
* Periodically wraps his body in bandages and becomes immune to damage.
* Spawns a {{e|Rag Man's Ragling}}. They will leave remains on the ground after death.
* Fires 3 beams from the sky that travel outwards. If the beam hits the remains of a dead Ragling, it is revived.

